        "conversion_check": {
          "description": "For an encoded demonstrated slot, anchor addition reconstructs the commanded world TCP position and valid 6D columns reconstruct its rotation. The independent check compares the shared IK solution by URDF FK in metres/radians and compares the unchanged gripper scalar. Gram-Schmidt is only a finite-sample orientation projection; no Cartesian position projection or fallback controller is applied, and IK nonconvergence is reported.",
